Ya Fatema Zahra..(7)<br>
Ya Zahra, Ya Zahra, Ya Zahra<br>
Chand moharram ka roya aur hum<br>
jab aaya moharram, aur aankh hui nam<br>
ye madar e hasnain se, karte hai iltejaa<br>
saare azadaar, saare azadaar<br>
ya bint e nabi fatima tashreef le aao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
1. Ghar apna azakhana e shabbir banaya<br>
matam ke liye farsh e azaa ghar mein bichaya<br>
Ya Fatema Zehra tumhe purse ko bulaya..(2)<br>
saqqa e sakina ka alam ham ne sajaya<br>
tum aake azakhane ki tauqeer badhao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi...<br>
<br>
2. Jo aapne paye hai sare karbobala ghum<br>
hum ehle azaa laye hai un zakhmo ka marham<br>
ye sozo salam aaho buka marsiya matam..(2)<br>
barsaenge aankho se abhi ashk e azaa hum<br>
aye bibi inhe zeenat e rumaal banao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi..<br>
<br>
3. Ek roz mein ujda hai jo zainab ka bhara ghar<br>
us ghar ke azadaar hai sab farsh e azaa par<br>
peetenge azadaar kabhi seena kabhi sar..(2)<br>
thoda to sukoo payega faryaad ko sunkar<br>
hamraah agar sayyed e sajjad ko lao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi..<br>
<br>
4. Hum shakl e payambar ka hai besheer ka matam<br>
laila ki buka banu e dilgeer ka matam<br>
behno mein bapa chadar e tatheer ka matam..(2)<br>
sajjad ke zakhmo ka hai zanjeer ka matam<br>
abbas ko aur zainab e muztar ko bulao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi..<br>
<br>
5. Barpa hai yaha'n qasim o abbas ka matam<br>
hai dukhtar e shabbir ke ehsaas ka matam<br>
sukhe hue kuzo'n ka kabhi pyaas ka matam..(2)<br>
jo toot gayi dasht mein us aas ka matam<br>
sharbat pe alamdaar ki ab nazr dilao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi..<br>
<br>
6. Aye bibi zara shor suno aaho buka ka<br>
dil tukde hua jaata hai har ehle azaa ka<br>
zakir ne kiya zikr jo bazaar e jafa ka..(2)<br>
kya haal hai pucho to zara zainul ebaa ka<br>
bazaar ka hai zikr to baqir ko bhi lao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi..<br>
<br>
7. Begoro kafan sayyed e zeeshan ka pursa<br>
bazaar ka pursa hai ye zindaan ka pursa<br>
sadaat ke bikhre hue samaan ka pursa..(2)<br>
manzoor karo mazhar o irfan ka pursa<br>
mil jaye sanad nauhe pe gar ashk bahao<br>
baithe hai azadaar azakhane mein aao, azakhane mein aao<br>
<br>
Ya binte nabi..<br>
Ya Zahra, Ya Zahra, Ya Zahra